# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PCB defect-generation project (ICCE-TW 2026 / ICETA 2026)
#
# This repository tracks CODE, RESULT FILES and FIGURES only. Model weights and
# image data are not in this repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Virtualenv (5.4 GB; the stock template above only covers venv/ and env/)
.venv/

# IDE
.idea/

# Model weights -- 51 GB across 236 files. Never in git.
# Matches "checkpoint/" and the Dec-2024 "checkpoint (cropped ...)/" dirs.
checkpoint*/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# Extracted VQ-VAE codes -- regenerable via extract_code_labeled.py
lmdb/

logs/

# Image data -- HRIPCB-derived, not in this repository
PCB*/
VOC_PCB/

# Generated / sampled imagery and review assets
sample*/
synth_*/
recon_*/
demo_pool/
demo_timelapse/
*review_assets/
*.npy

# Loose imagery at repo root (ICCE-TW-era scratch)
/*.png
/*.jpg

# ...but the paper figures and result files ARE tracked
!figures/
!figures/*.png
!results/

# fig_samples is a published artefact, not scratch: the PNG needs an explicit
# negation to escape /*.png above. The PDF is not ignored by any rule (there is
# deliberately no /*.pdf), so it needs none. Both are regenerated by
# analysis/make_fig_samples.py, which prints the selection provenance.
!/fig_samples.png

# Untracked on 2026-07-28: belong to neither paper, imported and invoked by
# nothing. Kept on disk as historical scratch; ignored so `git status` stays
# clean. (randomlyCopyImageFiles.py was untracked
# in the same pass and RESTORED — it is ICCE-TW-era PCB work, not MVTec.)
/augmentMVTecImageFiles.py
/pixelsnail_mnist.py
/eval_demo_pool.py

# Untracked on 2026-10-02: review pages whose ~1,150 images (*review_assets/,
# derived from HRIPCB crops) were never in git, so they rendered broken in any
# clone. Regenerated locally by build_*review.py. The data behind them is in
# results/duplicates.json, generation_review.json, samples_review.json.
/review.html
/duplicates_review.html
/generation_review.html
/samples_review.html
